# Model file of the extremes set XSET-1: FS242B = the lr 1e-4 arm of the from-scratch paper run, chain
# gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4_b1e4: a second copy started from the 150k checkpoint of FS242 (chain gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4, lr 5e-4)
# and trained beside it at lr 1e-4 (owner's "go 1e-4 arm", 18 Nov 2026 11:02 UTC; Jupiter job 2983361). Same network,
# same 12 outputs, same code tree and pins as FS242. The pair FS242_200k / FS242B_200k separates learning rate from
# training length.
# Values from the from-scratch thread, 18 Nov 2026 12:55 UTC. PROVEN by the smoke of 19 Nov 2026 (Jupiter 2999201, row
# FS242B_smoke175k: EMA load 0 missing 0 unexpected, SMOKE_PASS). A new model gets its smoke from xset_row.sh (it runs it
# first, once). RUN_DIR is the chain folder itself: its run folder holds the EMA exports. The chain keeps only its last
# raw by-step file, so give the raw file in front of xset_row.sh unless it is still in the run folder:
#   RAW_FILE=<raw by-step copy of that step, or of any step of this network> bash xset_row.sh FS242B_200k FS242B 200000
# (the raw file only builds the trainer; the EMA weights are then loaded strictly).
S=/e/data1/jureap-data/ecmwf/users/jdumont/sandbox/20261111-gs-global-crop
MODEL_NAME=gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4_b1e4
RUN_DIR=$S/chains/gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4_b1e4
CFG_DIR=$S/configs
CFG_NAME=gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4_b1e4
EXPECT_CODE=sandbox/20261111-gs-global-crop/code/anemoi-core
CODE_ROOT=$S/code/anemoi-core
CODE_SHA_FILE=$S/CODE_PIN
DATASETS_SHA_FILE=$S/DATASETS_PIN
ANCHOR=20230101:24
